  "summary": "In C17, the threshold is computed per cell from \u00b15-day pools of baseline years, smoothed circularly, and then indexed as thr_s[t_doy]. Because t_doy is 1-based but the array is 0-based, smoothed rows for DOY 154\u2013245 are used; these draw on raw pools for DOY 139\u2013260, i.e. baseline dates May 13\u2013Sep 21 of each year. The thresholds are compared with all 92 target days for every sea cell, and run detection and gap joining follow before the mask is written to output/mhw_mask.nc."
